7 (h) suits for the recovery of over-payments of rent or land revenue or of any other demand for which a suit lies in a Revenue Court under this sub-section;
Third Group (i) suits by a landowner for arrears of rent or for the money equivalent of rent 1[***]; and (j) suits for sums payable on account of land revenue or of any other demand recoverable as an arrear of land revenue under any enactment for the time being in force.
